  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "Passive: battle-start tank summon; Active: cast is adjacent AoE smash",
    "skill1": "grant growth buff to ally summon, boosting haste and life drain",
    "skill2": "summon a ranged ally",
    "skill3": "combat ATK bonus with multiple summons on field",
    "skill4": "grant permanent shield to each allied summon when they enter battle",
    "skill5": "large summons gain control immunity and ATK boost"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Florabelle]] opens with a battle-start tank summon, then smashes adjacent tiles on ultimate while buffing allied summons with Haste and Life Drain. She can summon a ranged ally, and combat ATK rises with multiple summons on the field. Each allied summon gains a permanent shield on entry, while large summons gain control immunity and ATK. She peaks in summon-heavy compositions that keep bodies alive. Teams that wipe her critters early prevent her scaling and shields from building.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Florabelle]] opens with a battle-start tank summon, then grows allied summons with Haste, Life Drain, and entry shields while her ultimate smashes adjacent tiles. Clear the summons before permanent shields and ATK stacks build; her damage collapses without bodies. Use lasting coverage like [[Shemira]] or [[Gwyneth]], and [[Lily May]] to catch the smash wind-up. If the second wave is delayed, delete [[Florabelle]] with [[filter:assassin-delete]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]]."
}
